{"total_count":1165,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/07669ed9605a33a36078aae84756c0df6f071884","sha":"07669ed9605a33a36078aae84756c0df6f071884","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0NjU2MDA5NzU6MDc2NjllZDk2MDVhMzNhMzYwNzhhYWU4NDc1NmMwZGY2ZjA3MTg4NA==","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/commit/07669ed9605a33a36078aae84756c0df6f071884","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/07669ed9605a33a36078aae84756c0df6f071884/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/git/commits/07669ed9605a33a36078aae84756c0df6f071884","author":{"date":"2025-01-17T15:13:25.000-08:00","name":"Aaron Orenstein","email":"aorenste@meta.com"},"committer":{"date":"2025-01-18T05:05:07.000Z","name":"PyTorch MergeBot","email":"pytorchmergebot@users.noreply.github.com"},"message":"PEP585 update - benchmarks tools torchgen (#145101)\n\nThis is one of a series of PRs to update us to PEP585 (changing Dict -> dict, List -> list, etc).  Most of the PRs were completely automated with RUFF as follows:\n\nSince RUFF UP006 is considered an \"unsafe\" fix first we need to enable unsafe fixes:\n\n```\n--- a/tools/linter/adapters/ruff_linter.py\n+++ b/tools/linter/adapters/ruff_linter.py\n@@ -313,6 +313,7 @@\n                     \"ruff\",\n                     \"check\",\n                     \"--fix-only\",\n+                    \"--unsafe-fixes\",\n                     \"--exit-zero\",\n                     *([f\"--config={config}\"] if config else []),\n                     \"--stdin-filename\",\n```\n\nThen we need to tell RUFF to allow UP006 (as a final PR once all of these have landed this will be made permanent):\n\n```\n--- a/pyproject.toml\n+++ b/pyproject.toml\n@@ -40,7 +40,7 @@\n\n [tool.ruff]\n-target-version = \"py38\"\n+target-version = \"py39\"\n line-length = 88\n src = [\"caffe2\", \"torch\", \"torchgen\", \"functorch\", \"test\"]\n\n@@ -87,7 +87,6 @@\n     \"SIM116\", # Disable Use a dictionary instead of consecutive `if` statements\n     \"SIM117\",\n     \"SIM118\",\n-    \"UP006\", # keep-runtime-typing\n     \"UP007\", # keep-runtime-typing\n ]\n select = [\n```\n\nFinally running `lintrunner -a --take RUFF` will fix up the deprecated uses.\n\nPull Request resolved: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/145101\nApproved by: https://github.com/bobrenjc93","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/git/trees/174b76464c3ac6b330428919dc58c91d1ca30742","sha":"174b76464c3ac6b330428919dc58c91d1ca30742"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"aorenste","id":19294870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0ODcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste","html_url":"https://github.com/aorenste","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aorenste/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"pytorchmergebot","id":97764156,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdPDPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97764156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorchmergebot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/gists{/